  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Stub for Honshu, Shikoku, Kyushu, Hokkaido printed with ditto marks ('( „ „ „ )') repeating '(incl. outlying islands)'; expanded.",
   "Row 'Shikoku', col 'Coast line': unreadable — last digit of '1,649.1_' is broken (looks like 8 or 3); left blank.",
   "Kwantung and Pacific Mandate sq. km figures printed in parentheses, i.e. not included in the total; transcribed with the parentheses as printed.",
   "Population density: printed as '(Average density per sq. kilometre—120)' on the Population line and '( „ ... —156)' on the Japan proper line; million figures printed as '59.73 million' then ditto marks; expanded.",
   "Japan proper sub-items (Honshu+Shikoku+Kyushu+Hokkaido+Others) sq. miles sum to 147,253.39 vs printed 147,651.65 — does NOT reconcile (diff 398.26). Cells re-read; figures as printed.",
   "Total sq. miles 260,704.23: Japan proper+Taiwan+Karafuto+Chosen sum to 248,794.13 — does NOT reconcile (diff 11,910.10). Cells re-read; figures as printed.",
   "Percent of area: Japan proper+Taiwan+Karafuto+Chosen = 100.00 — reconciles to 100; Japan-proper sub-items sum to 56.63 vs printed 56.64 (diff 0.01, rounding).",
   "Coast line: Japan proper sub-items excluding the unreadable Shikoku figure sum to 15,523.49; the printed 17,179.98 would imply Shikoku = 1,656.49, which does not match the legible '1,649.1_' — sub-items do NOT reconcile with the Japan proper total whatever the last digit.",
   "Area 680,762 sq. km: sq. km column (with Japan proper built from its island figures, which lack 'Others') cannot be checked because Japan proper and Others have no sq. km figure."
  ],
