   "Row 'Mogami', col 'Navigable length — km.': unreadable — '4_9', middle digit blurred (5 or 3); left blank.",
   "Thousands separators printed as period-like marks in 'Mogami sq. km. 7.400', 'Omono sq. miles 1.614', 'Rakuto sq. miles 9.212'; transcribed as seen. Several other separators are blurred but read as commas.",
